{"seq":3,"slug":"rto-rpo-and-dr-strategy","title":"RTO/RPO 与灾备策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery/rto-rpo-and-dr-strategy","wordCount":1894,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"rto-rpo-与灾备策略\">RTO/RPO 与灾备策略</h1><p>把一次区域级故障想象成一道选择题：你愿意为「业务必须在多久内恢复」和「最多能丢多少数据」各付出多大代价？这两个旋钮就是 RTO（Recovery Time Objective，恢复时间目标）和 RPO（Recovery Point Objective，恢复点目标）。它们不是技术指标，而是一份和业务方签下的成本契约——把它们写死之后，灾备架构的形态、预算和复杂度几乎就被反推出来了。混沌工程之所以和灾备同章，是因为光在 PPT 上写下「RTO=2 小时」毫无意义；只有用 game day 把整套故障切换真跑一遍，才知道这个数字是真还是假。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-用两个时间轴定义可接受的损失\">核心概念：用两个时间轴定义可接受的损失</h2><p>RTO 和 RPO 都以「灾难发生那一刻」为原点，但指向两个相反的方向。RPO 看向过去：从灾难时刻回溯到最后一次有效备份/复制点之间的窗口，就是你会永久丢失的数据量；RTO 看向未来：从灾难时刻到业务重新对外可用之间的时长，就是你要承受的停机。一个常见的误区是把两者混为一谈——RPO=0 不代表 RTO=0，你可能数据一字不丢（同步复制），但拉起备用环境仍需要 40 分钟。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[最后一次有效复制点] --&gt;|RPO 数据丢失窗口| B[灾难发生 t0]&#10;  B --&gt;|RTO 业务停机窗口| C[业务恢复对外可用]&#10;  B --&gt; D[决策: 损失多少数据&lt;br/&gt;+ 停机多久可接受]&#10;  D --&gt; E[反推灾备策略层级&lt;br/&gt;与预算]\">flowchart TD\n  A[最后一次有效复制点] --&gt;|RPO 数据丢失窗口| B[灾难发生 t0]\n  B --&gt;|RTO 业务停机窗口| C[业务恢复对外可用]\n  B --&gt; D[决策: 损失多少数据&lt;br/&gt;+ 停机多久可接受]\n  D --&gt; E[反推灾备策略层级&lt;br/&gt;与预算]</pre><p>两者越接近零，成本曲线越陡峭。把 RTO/RPO 降一个数量级，往往意味着把灾备预算翻几倍。下面这张表对应 AWS 官方白皮书归纳的四档主流策略，金额来自 2026 年公开成本拆解（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/disaster-recovery-workloads-on-aws/disaster-recovery-options-in-the-cloud.html\">AWS DR 白皮书</a>、<a href=\"https://www.factualminds.com/blog/aws-disaster-recovery-strategies-pilot-light-warm-standby-multi-site/\">factualminds 成本拆解</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>典型 RTO</th>\n<th>典型 RPO</th>\n<th>备用环境成本（相对生产）</th>\n<th>适用业务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>备份恢复 Backup &amp; Restore</td>\n<td>数小时～1 天</td>\n<td>数小时</td>\n<td>~5%–10%（仅存储费）</td>\n<td>内部工具、低优先级系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暖备 Pilot Light</td>\n<td>数十分钟</td>\n<td>数分钟</td>\n<td>生产 RDS $500/月 → 只读副本约 $250–350/月</td>\n<td>重要业务系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温备 Warm Standby</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>生产 $5000/月 → 约 $1000–1500/月</td>\n<td>营收相关系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多活 Multi-Site Active/Active</td>\n<td>近零</td>\n<td>近零</td>\n<td>~100%+（双倍跑生产）</td>\n<td>营收关键、不容停机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把-rto-rpo-翻译成复制拓扑\">把 RTO/RPO 翻译成复制拓扑</h2><p>RPO 的物理上限由你的数据复制方式决定，这一步绕不过去。同步复制（写主库时等从库 ACK）能把 RPO 压到 0，代价是每次写入都要付出跨可用区/跨区域的网络往返延迟；异步复制延迟低，但复制滞后多少，RPO 就是多少。一个实用的近似是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RPO</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>复制滞后</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>待复制日志积压量</mtext><mtext>复制吞吐</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RPO} \\approx \\text{复制滞后} = \\frac{\\text{待复制日志积压量}}{\\text{复制吞吐}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RPO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">复制滞后</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">复制吞吐</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">待复制日志积压量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着当主库写入洪峰超过复制管道吞吐时，RPO 会动态恶化——平时测出来 5 秒，大促时可能飙到几分钟。所以 RPO 不能只在低峰期测一次就当成承诺。</p>\n<p>RTO 同样是一串环节时间的累加，而不是单一数字。把它拆开看会发现「数据其实早就在那里」往往不是瓶颈，DNS 切换、容量扩容、缓存预热这些「最后一公里」才是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTO</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>检测</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>决策</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>切换</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>扩容</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>预热</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>验证</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTO} = T_{\\text{检测}} + T_{\\text{决策}} + T_{\\text{切换}} + T_{\\text{扩容}} + T_{\\text{预热}} + T_{\\text{验证}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">检测</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">决策</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">切换</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">扩容</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">预热</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">验证</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>暖备之所以能把 RTO 做到分钟级，不是因为它复制更快，而是因为它让备用环境一直保持「缩水版生产」常驻运行——<a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/insights/aws-disaster-recovery-strategy-guide\">Cohesity/Rubrik 等 2026 指南</a>反复强调，温备维持一个数据已同步、按比例缩小的活环境，灾难时只需把现有资源横向扩容即可在分钟内恢复，省掉了从零拉起的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>扩容</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{扩容}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">扩容</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层定级-别给所有系统买同一份保险\">分层定级：别给所有系统买同一份保险</h2><p>一刀切的灾备策略要么烧钱、要么裸奔。2026 年的主流做法是按业务关键度分层：营收关键系统上多活，重要业务系统上温备，其余一律备份恢复（<a href=\"https://www.n-ix.com/aws-disaster-recovery-strategies/\">n-ix</a>、<a href=\"https://www.factualminds.com/blog/aws-disaster-recovery-strategies-pilot-light-warm-standby-multi-site/\">factualminds</a>）。定级的输入不是工程师的偏好，而是业务影响分析（BIA）：每个系统停机一小时损失多少钱、波及哪些下游依赖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[业务影响分析 BIA] --&gt; B{停机损失&lt;br/&gt;与依赖范围}&#10;  B --&gt;|营收关键 不容停机| C[多活 Active/Active&lt;br/&gt;RTO 近零]&#10;  B --&gt;|重要业务系统| D[温备 Warm Standby&lt;br/&gt;RTO 分钟级]&#10;  B --&gt;|一般业务| E[暖备 Pilot Light&lt;br/&gt;RTO 数十分钟]&#10;  B --&gt;|内部/低优先级| F[备份恢复&lt;br/&gt;RTO 数小时+]&#10;  C --&gt; G[定级写入灾备登记表&lt;br/&gt;每年随 BIA 复审]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[业务影响分析 BIA] --&gt; B{停机损失&lt;br/&gt;与依赖范围}\n  B --&gt;|营收关键 不容停机| C[多活 Active/Active&lt;br/&gt;RTO 近零]\n  B --&gt;|重要业务系统| D[温备 Warm Standby&lt;br/&gt;RTO 分钟级]\n  B --&gt;|一般业务| E[暖备 Pilot Light&lt;br/&gt;RTO 数十分钟]\n  B --&gt;|内部/低优先级| F[备份恢复&lt;br/&gt;RTO 数小时+]\n  C --&gt; G[定级写入灾备登记表&lt;br/&gt;每年随 BIA 复审]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>落地时有两条 2026 年被反复提及的硬规矩。其一是 3-2-1 备份法则：三份副本、两种介质、至少一份异地，并对其中一份做气隙（air gap）或不可变（immutable）存储，专门用来扛勒索软件——因为攻击者会先删你的备份（<a href=\"https://www.cohesity.com/deep-dives/role-of-rto-rpo-in-disaster-recovery/\">Cohesity</a>）。其二是用 IaC（Terraform / CloudFormation）把灾备站点写成可复现、可版本化的代码；2026 年的灾备已经深度嵌进 IaC、CI/CD 与可观测性，而不再是一次性的运维脚本（<a href=\"https://calmops.com/cloud/cloud-disaster-recovery-2026/\">Calmops</a>、<a href=\"https://www.refontelearning.com/blog/cloud-native-disaster-recover-and-resilience-engineering\">Refonte Learning</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用混沌工程验证你声称的数字\">用混沌工程验证你声称的数字</h2><p>写在文档里的 RTO/RPO 是「目标」，跑出来的才是「能力」，两者之间的鸿沟只能靠演练填平。这正是混沌工程进场的地方：通过主动注入故障，暴露传统测试覆盖不到的盲区，从而修正 runbook、改进恢复手段（<a href=\"https://www.conduktor.io/blog/chaos-testing-for-kafka-compliance-dr-evidence-that-works\">Conduktor</a>、<a href=\"https://www.gremlin.com/community/tutorials/testing-disaster-recovery-with-chaos-engineering\">Gremlin</a>）。</p>\n<p>最常见的形式是 game day（也叫 fire drill）：多个相关团队参与，对大多数参与者隐藏具体故障细节，在受控但贴近真实的条件下演练区域切换、从备份恢复，并实测 RTO/RPO 是否达标。<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-28-chaos-engineering-game-days/view\">OneUptime 2026 年 1 月的指南</a>指出，game day 提供了自动化混沌给不了的东西：跨团队协同、runbook 验证、工具核验和知识传递。AWS Fault Injection Service、Azure Chaos Studio 等托管工具则让「真的拔掉一个区域」变成可重复、可回滚的实验（<a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/advancing-microsoft-azure-resilience-with-chaos-studio/\">Azure Chaos Studio</a>）。</p>\n<p>演练要测量的核心指标，是从故障注入那一刻到业务恢复的实测耗时，并和 MTTR（平均恢复时间）一起判断 RTO/RPO 是否真的够用。下面是一个最小化的区域故障演练脚本骨架——重点不在命令本身，而在「打时间戳、量真实数字」这件事：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env bash&#10;set -euo pipefail&#10;t0=$(date +%s)                                   # 故障注入时刻 = RTO/RPO 原点&#10;aws fis start-experiment --experiment-template-id &quot;$TEMPLATE_ID&quot;  # 注入区域故障&#10;&#10;# 轮询备用区域健康检查，直到对外可用&#10;until curl -fsS https://app.example.com/healthz &gt;/dev/null 2&gt;&amp;1; do&#10;  sleep 5&#10;done&#10;t1=$(date +%s)&#10;echo &quot;实测 RTO = $((t1 - t0)) 秒&quot;                 # 与目标 RTO 对比&#10;&#10;# RPO 取灾难前最后一次成功复制点与 t0 的差值（从复制延迟监控读取）&#10;echo &quot;实测 RPO = ${REPLICATION_LAG_AT_T0} 秒&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -euo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pipefail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 故障注入时刻 = RTO/RPO 原点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aws</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fis</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start-experiment</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --experiment-template-id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$TEMPLATE_ID</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 注入区域故障</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 轮询备用区域健康检查，直到对外可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">until</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsS</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://app.example.com/healthz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"实测 RTO = $((</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> - t0)) 秒\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 # 与目标 RTO 对比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># RPO 取灾难前最后一次成功复制点与 t0 的差值（从复制延迟监控读取）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"实测 RPO = ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">REPLICATION_LAG_AT_T0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 秒\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>监管层面这件事已经从「最佳实践」升级为「法定义务」。欧盟 DORA（数字运营韧性法案）2025 年 1 月 17 日生效，要求金融机构的关键功能必须在事故后两小时内恢复（一条明确的 RTO 红线），并强制每年至少一次恢复测试、每三年一次威胁导向渗透测试；监管机构明确推荐用混沌工程在模拟压力下验证韧性控制（<a href=\"https://www.bmc.com/learn/digital-operations-resilience-act-dora-explained.html\">BMC</a>、<a href=\"https://cutover.com/blog/disaster-recovery-compliance-dora-regulation-challenges\">Cutover</a>、<a href=\"https://www.coforge.com/what-we-know/blog/quality-engineering-led-dora-operational-resilience-testing\">Coforge</a>）。换句话说，能不能拿出 game day 的实测证据，正在变成合规审计的硬通货。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RTO 看向未来（停机多久），RPO 看向过去（丢多少数据），同以灾难时刻为原点；二者是业务成本契约，不是纯技术指标。</li>\n<li>RPO 的物理上限由复制方式（同步/异步）决定，且会随写入洪峰动态恶化；RTO 是检测、决策、切换、扩容、预热、验证多段时间之和，瓶颈常在「最后一公里」。</li>\n<li>四档策略（备份恢复 / 暖备 / 温备 / 多活）在 RTO、RPO、成本三轴上权衡：把目标降一个数量级，预算往往翻几倍。</li>\n<li>用 BIA 分层定级，按业务关键度分配策略；叠加 3-2-1 + 不可变备份扛勒索、用 IaC 让灾备站点可复现。</li>\n<li>文档里的数字只是「目标」，混沌工程 game day 跑出来的才是「能力」；DORA 等监管已把「关键功能两小时内恢复 + 年度恢复测试」写成法定红线，实测证据成为合规硬通货。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RTO/RPO 与灾备策略","id":"rto-rpo-与灾备策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：用两个时间轴定义可接受的损失","id":"核心概念-用两个时间轴定义可接受的损失"},{"level":2,"text":"把 RTO/RPO 翻译成复制拓扑","id":"把-rto-rpo-翻译成复制拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"分层定级：别给所有系统买同一份保险","id":"分层定级-别给所有系统买同一份保险"},{"level":2,"text":"用混沌工程验证你声称的数字","id":"用混沌工程验证你声称的数字"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多区域故障转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery/multi-region-failover"},"next":null}